### ===== Rosa Contabilidade - Testes de API =====
### Use com a extensão REST Client do VS Code ou similar

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminToken = SEU_TOKEN_AQUI
@clienteToken = SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

### ===== AUTH =====

### Login Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@admin.com",
  "password": "TrocarNaPrimeiraSenha123!"
}

### Login Cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria.silva@exemplo.com",
  "password": "Cliente123!"
}

### Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "SEU_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### Forgot Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@admin.com"
}

### Reset Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@admin.com",
  "token": "TOKEN_DO_FORGOT_PASSWORD",
  "newPassword": "NovaSenha123!"
}

### Change Password (logado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "currentPassword": "TrocarNaPrimeiraSenha123!",
  "newPassword": "NovaSenha123!"
}

### Me
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ===== CALCULADORA (PÚBLICA) =====

### Calcular PJ Simples
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculator
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipoPessoa": "PJ",
  "receitaMensal": 30000,
  "despesasDedutiveis": 5000,
  "aliquotaEstimada": null,
  "opcaoRegime": "simples"
}

### Calcular PF
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculator
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipoPessoa": "PF",
  "receitaMensal": 15000,
  "despesasDedutiveis": 3000,
  "aliquotaEstimada": null,
  "opcaoRegime": null
}

### Calcular PJ Lucro Presumido
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculator
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipoPessoa": "PJ",
  "receitaMensal": 50000,
  "despesasDedutiveis": 0,
  "aliquotaEstimada": null,
  "opcaoRegime": "geral"
}

### ===== LEADS =====

### Criar Lead via Contato
POST {{baseUrl}}/leads/contato
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Dr. Teste",
  "email": "teste@email.com",
  "telefone": "(11) 99999-9999",
  "mensagem": "Gostaria de saber mais sobre os serviços."
}

### Criar Lead via Calculadora
POST {{baseUrl}}/leads/calculadora
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Dr. Calculadora",
  "email": "calc@email.com",
  "telefone": "(11) 88888-8888",
  "tipoPessoa": "PJ",
  "receitaMensal": 30000,
  "despesasDedutiveis": 5000,
  "aliquotaEstimada": null,
  "opcaoRegime": "simples",
  "impostoEstimado": 2700,
  "percentualEfetivo": 0.09
}

### Listar Leads (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Listar Leads - Filtrar por origem
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads?origem=calculadora
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Excluir Lead
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/leads/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ===== CLIENTES =====

### Listar Clientes (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Criar Cliente (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/clients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "email": "novo.cliente@exemplo.com",
  "password": "NovoCliente123!",
  "fullName": "Novo Cliente Teste",
  "cpfCnpj": "123.456.789-00",
  "regimeObservacoes": "PF - Teste"
}

### Dashboard do Cliente (logado como cliente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clients/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{clienteToken}}

### Atualizar Cliente
PUT {{baseUrl}}/clients/ID_DO_CLIENTE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Nome Atualizado",
  "cpfCnpj": "123.456.789-00",
  "phoneNumber": "(11) 99999-0000",
  "regimeObservacoes": "PF - Atualizado"
}

### ===== PENDÊNCIAS =====

### Listar Pendências (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pendencies
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Minhas Pendências (Cliente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pendencies/minhas
Authorization: Bearer {{clienteToken}}

### Criar Pendência (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pendencies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "descricao": "Enviar comprovante de rendimentos",
  "clienteId": "ID_DO_CLIENTE",
  "dataLimite": "2024-12-31T00:00:00Z",
  "resolvida": false
}

### ===== LINKS DE PAGAMENTO =====

### Listar Links (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/paymentlinks
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Meus Links (Cliente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/paymentlinks/meus
Authorization: Bearer {{clienteToken}}

### Criar Link (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/paymentlinks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "descricao": "Honorários Janeiro 2024",
  "clienteId": "ID_DO_CLIENTE",
  "url": "https://pag.ae/exemplo123",
  "valor": 500.00,
  "pago": false
}

### ===== DOCUMENTOS =====

### Meus Documentos (Cliente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/meus
Authorization: Bearer {{clienteToken}}

### Download Documento
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/1/download
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Excluir Documento (Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/documents/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
